# Naming conventions

- **Files and folders**: kebab-case (`hello-world.vue`, `user-profile.ts`)
- **Functions and local/const variables**: camelCase (`getUserById`, `isLoading`)
- **Global constants**: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE (`API_BASE_URL`, `MAX_RETRY_COUNT`)
- **Names must be descriptive**: prefer clear intent over abbreviations or vague names (`data`, `temp`, `handle`, `fn`)

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
const MaxRetryCount = 3;
const d = fetch();
function Get_User() {}
function doStuff(x) {}
// file: HelloWorld.vue

// ✅ GOOD
const MAX_RETRY_COUNT = 3;
const userProfile = fetch();
function getUser() {}
function calculateOrderTotal(order) {}
// file: hello-world.vue
```
